Third-party data
----------------
Parts of the game-data tables in crates/p4g-core/assets/data were checked
against data published by these projects:

- vware/P4G-Save-Tool (MIT-equivalent license): item/persona/skill name
  lists used for cross-checking.
- aqiu384/megaten-fusion-tool (Unlicense): persona stats, skills and
  levels used to build personas.tsv.

